tic","domain_aligned":["slice_eligible"],"cost_layer":{"fatigue":1,"notice":0,"corruption":0,"authority":0,"ruin":0,"creation":0,"scaling_rule":"L2: duration up to 8 hr concentration. L3: duration up to 24 hr concentration. L4+: 24 hr."},"regional_school_id":null,"regional_origin_id":null,"regional_pantheon_alignment":null},{"spell_id":"mark_stay","name":"Mark Stay","level":0,"school":"enchantment","casting_time":"1 action","range":"touch","duration":{"kind":"permanent"},"components":{"v":false,"s":true,"m":true,"m_text":"a fingertip''s worth of dust, ash, or salt","m_consumed":true},"classes_allowed":["wizard","sorcerer","warlock","cleric","paladin","bard"],"concentration":false,"ritual_eligible":false,"description_template":"Leave an invisible mark on object or place. Mark is detectable to scryers, Mark Stay casters, and creatures with True Seeing. Holds caster''s name-signature. Mark persists until removed by Dispel Magic or until caster releases it. Wild twist: marks accumulate; a place with 3+ marks from same caster gets +1 to any divination targeting that place.","save_type":null,"attack_kind":null,"domain_aligned":["subschool_marking_spells"],"regional_school_id":null,"regional_origin_id":null,"regional_pantheon_alignment":null},{"spell_id":"witness_true","name":"Witness True","level":0,"school":"divination","casting_time":"1 action","range":"30 ft","duration":{"kind":"instant"},"components":{"v":true,"s":true,"m":false},"classes_allowed":["wizard","sorcerer","warlock","cleric","paladin","bard"],"concentration":false,"ritual_eligible":false,"description_template":"Compel target within range to reveal one single truth they hold and recall in this moment. CHA save resists. On fail, target says one true sentence; cannot exceed 12 words; cannot be about a memory the target does not believe. Target aware they revealed the truth. Wild twist: if you cast Witness True with NO witnesses (other than target) present, save DC +2. If 3+ witnesses present, save DC -2.","save_type":"cha","attack_kind":null,"domain_aligned":["subschool_witness_spells","imposed_eligible"],"regional_school_id":null,"regional_origin_id":null,"regional_pantheon_alignment":null},{"spell_id":"name_pull","name":"Name Pull","level":0,"school":"enchantment","casting_time":"1 action","range":"30 ft","duration":{"kind":"instant"},"components":{"v":true,"s":false,"m":false},"classes_allowed":["wizard","sorcerer","warlock","bard","cleric"],"concentration":false,"ritual_eligible":false,"description_template":"Try to feel a target''s name within range. INT check vs target''s CHA save. On success, learn one name target uses (chosen-name, true-name, or used-name — random on a tie). On fail, gain nothing; target gains awareness someone tried to pull a name. Wild twist: this cantrip cannot be cast on the same target twice within the same long rest cycle; the target''s name ''sets'' against you for that window.","save_type":"cha","attack_kind":null,"domain_aligned":["subschool_naming_spells","imposed_eligible"],"regional_school_id":null,"regional_origin_id":null,"regional_pantheon_alignment":null},{"spell_id":"contradiction_bolt","name":"Contradiction Bolt","level":1,"school":"evocation","casting_time":"1 action","range":"60 ft","duration":{"kind":"instant"},"components":{"v":true,"s":true,"m":false},"classes_allowed":["wizard","sorcerer","warlock"],"concentration":false,"ritual_eligible":false,"description_template":"Ranged spell attack. On hit, 1d6 force damage. ADD +1d6 force damage per active belief in target''s belief-ledger that contradicts a recent action target took. (State Manager queries belief vs event log; max +3d6.) Twist: this spell, by being NAMED what it is, makes the target briefly aware of their own contradictions during the strike — Insight check by target available next turn against caster.","save_type":null,"attack_kind":"ranged","domain_aligned":["subschool_contradiction_burst"],"regional_school_id":null,"regional_origin_id":null,"regional_pantheon_alignment":null,"damage_dice":"1d6+X","damage_type":"force","cost_layer":{"fatigue":1,"notice":0,"corruption":0,"authority":0,"ruin":0,"creation":0,"scaling_rule":"L2+: base +1d6 per slot level above 1; contradiction bonus unchanged."}},{"spell_id":"hum_of_witnesses","name":"Hum of Witnesses","level":1,"school":"evocation","casting_time":"1 action","range":"self (30-ft radius)","duration":{"kind":"concentration","max_minutes":60},"components":{"v":true,"s":false,"m":false},"classes_allowed":["bard","warlock"],"concentration":true,"ritual_eligible":false,"description_template":"Low resonant hum surrounds you. Allies in radius gain +1 to attack/save when at least 3 other creatures are observing the combat (audience-as-power). Twist: if combat is in a place historically associated with mass-witness events (a square, a court, a market), bonus increases to +2.","save_type":null,"attack_kind":null,"domain_aligned":["subschool_resonance"],"regional_school_id":null,"regional_origin_id":null,"regional_pantheon_alignment":null,"cost_layer":{"fatigue":1,"notice":0,"corruption":0,"authority":0,"ruin":0,"creation":0}}]'::jsonb) AS x
